llaboration","topic":"Digital Tools","code":"6-8.DTC.a.2","text":"Identify the kinds of content associated with different file types and why different file types exist (e.g., formats for word processing, images, music, three-dimensional drawings.)."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Digital Tools","code":"6-8.DTC.a.3","text":"Integrate information from multiple file formats into a single artifact."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Digital Tools","code":"6-8.DTC.a.4","text":"Individually and collaboratively use advanced tools to design and create online content (e.g., digital portfolio, multimedia, blog, webpage)."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Digital Tools","code":"6-8.DTC.a.5","text":"Individually and collaboratively develop and conduct an online survey."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Collaboration and Communication","code":"6-8.DTC.b.1","text":"Communicate and publish key ideas and details individually or collaboratively in a way that informs, persuades, and/or entertains using a variety of digital tools and media-rich resources."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Collaboration and Communication","code":"6-8.DTC.b.2","text":"Collaborate synchronously and asynchronously through online digital tools."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Collaboration and Communication","code":"6-8.DTC.b.3","text":"Demonstrate ability to communicate appropriately through various online tools (e.g., email, social media, texting, blog comments)."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Research","code":"6-8.DTC.c.1","text":"Perform advanced searches to locate information using a variety of digital sources (e.g., Boolean Operators, limiters like reading level, subject, media type)."},{"strand":"Digital Tools and Collaboration","topic":"Research","code":"6-8.DTC.c.2","text":"Evaluate quality of digital sources for reliability, including currency, r